    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Dr. WijayadasaRajapaksa, Minister of Education and Higher Education, on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission,do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the aforesaid Act, establishing the SouthEastern University of Sri Lanka, published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 916/7 of March 27, 1996 (as last amended byOrder published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2038/75 of September 29, 2017), by the addition immediately after theentry \u2018\u2018 (c) Department of Mathematical Sciences\u2019\u2019 appearing in Column II under the heading \u2018\u2018Department of Study\u2019\u2019which corresponds to the item \u2018\u2018Faculty of Applied Sciences\u2019\u2019 appearing in Column I under the heading \u2018\u2018Faculty\u2019\u2019 of theSchedule II to such Order, of the following new entry :-",
